    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>, you may make a DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check.&nbsp;If successful, you may spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to negate <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Side Points\">Dark Side Points</a> gained by activating <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> with the [<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Side\">Dark Side</a></i>] descriptor in your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power_Suite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power Suite\">Force Power Suite</a>; you may negate a number of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Side Points\">Dark Side Points</a> in this way equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> modifier (minimum 1).&nbsp;After successfully activating this Talent, you may not attempt it again for 24 hours.",
